IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0046.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY FEE0046C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> FEE WAIVER INDICATOR
    05 FEE-WAIVED         PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 MTH-FEE            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM WAIVE-FEE
    DISPLAY "FEE-WAIVED=" FEE-WAIVED
    DISPLAY "MTH-FEE=" MTH-FEE
    STOP RUN.
WAIVE-FEE.
    IF ACCT-TYP = 'G'
       OR ACCT-TYP = 'P'
       OR AVG-BALANCE >= 1500
        MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVED
        MOVE 0 TO MTH-FEE
    ELSE
        MOVE 7.50 TO MTH-FEE
    END-IF.
